    "title": "Special Weather Statement by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here At 147 AM CDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm near Schicke Point, or near Palacios, moving north at 20 mph. HAZARD...Wind gusts up to 40 mph. SOURCE...Radar indicated. IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around unsecured objects. Locations impacted include... Palacios, Port Alto, Blessing, and Schicke Point.",
